ling task, and once it returns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the calling task is suspended. It is possible to immediately resume the task, or escape the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"continuation in order to complete it afterwards, which will then resume the suspended task."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must invoke the continuation’s "},{"code":"resume","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method exactly once."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Missing to invoke it (eventually) will cause the calling task to remain suspended"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indefinitely which will result in the task “hanging” as well as being leaked with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no possibility to destroy it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The checked continuation offers detection of misuse, and dropping the last reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to it, without having resumed it will trigger a warning. Resuming a continuation twice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also diagnosed and will cause a crash."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"See Also","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"withCheckedThrowingContinuation(function:_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"withUnsafeContinuation(function:_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withUnsafeThrowingContinuation(function:_:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift"]]},"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/UnsafeContinuation"